; claude: self-play: can it teach itself? A network with two heads, a
; policy and a value (Policy_value), games played by the search against
; itself and kept as lessons (Selfplay), two players measured against
; each other (Arena), and the game they are first worked on
; (Tictactoe); notes_ai_learning.md section 16,
; plan_ai_zero_to_hero.md. After AlphaZero, and Jonathan Laurent's
; AlphaZero.jl. Above ai_search and ai_learning, which it joins. In the
; package tiny_libs, as tiny_libs.ai_selfplay; see ai/README.md.
